OL,5,G1800 Back Where We Belong
OL,6,     FFollow 25 years of Coventry City's
OL,7,     Frise back to the top. Sky Blues
OL,8,     Ffans remember the day their
OL,9,     FPremier League dream died and left
OL,10,     Fthem feeling shock, denial and
OL,11,     Fgrowing dread.
OL,12,G1815 Back Where We Belong
OL,13,     FFor Coventry City fans, leaving
OL,14,     FHighfield Road was more than just
OL,15,     Fa stadium move, it was saying
OL,16,     Fgoodbye to home.
OL,17,G1830 Back Where We Belong
OL,18,     FAn era defined by uncertainty,
OL,19,     Ffinancial trouble and a growing
OL,20,     Fsense of helplessness as the club
OL,21,     Fbegan to lose its way.
